WEBVTT

NOTE shipshape launch film. Voiceover by a synthetic voice (Chatterbox, Resemble AI). Music: Synthwave 4k by The Cynic Project, CC0.

1
00:00.920 --> 00:02.720
shipshape gets your repository in order,

2
00:02.720 --> 00:04.524
in one conversation.

3
00:05.320 --> 00:06.560
Run $shipshape-init.

4
00:06.560 --> 00:07.920
It asks a few plain questions,

5
00:07.920 --> 00:08.800
shows you the plan,

6
00:08.800 --> 00:11.214
and changes nothing until you say go.

7
00:12.720 --> 00:13.720
Security sits at the centre:

8
00:13.720 --> 00:15.120
a secret guard on every commit,

9
00:15.120 --> 00:17.120
CI, secret scanning, CodeQL,

10
00:17.120 --> 00:18.816
and a weekly health check.

11
00:19.670 --> 00:22.290
shipshape. A plugin for Codex and Claude Code.

12
00:22.290 --> 00:24.242
Free, and open source.
